Now, since Sun had failed to appoint a successor, three factions have now begun fighting for power. The Communists and Party Elders under Liao Zhongkai, the Leftists under Wang Jingwei and the Right Anti-Communist Party Elders under Hu Hanmin.

It is unclear who will win the succession crisis. It seems the KMT will face turmoil once again.
